# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run a managed workflow one time for each set of inputs, collect the results, and stay under the active job limit."
msgstr "Jalankan aliran kerja terurus sekali bagi setiap set input, kumpulkan hasilnya, dan kekal di bawah had job aktif."

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run a parameter sweep"
msgstr "Jalankan sapuan parameter"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"guides/run-parameter-sweep.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{/*\n"
"  DO NOT EDIT THIS CELL!!!\n"
"  This cell's content is generated automatically by a script. Anything you add\n"
"  here will be removed next time the notebook is run. To add new content, create\n"
"  a new cell before or after this one.\n"
"*/}\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Package versions\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Versi pakej\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The code on this page was developed using the following requirements.\n"
"We recommend using these versions or newer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kod pada halaman ini dibangunkan menggunakan keperluan berikut.\n"
"Kami mengesyorkan penggunaan versi ini atau yang lebih baharu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"A parameter sweep works like a Slurm job array. Call `run()` one time for each set of inputs, and the jobs run at the same time, each on its own node. Use the same pattern for any batch of independent inputs, such as one job for each molecule or each backend. Jobs cannot send data to each other, so split the work into independent inputs.\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Sapuan parameter berfungsi seperti tatasusunan job Slurm. Panggil `run()` sekali bagi setiap set input, dan job berjalan serentak, masing-masing pada nodnya sendiri. Gunakan corak yang sama untuk sebarang kelompok input bebas, seperti satu job bagi setiap molekul atau setiap backend. Job tidak boleh menghantar data antara satu sama lain, jadi pecahkan kerja kepada input yang bebas.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The examples on this page use the workflow from [Run a managed workflow](/guides/run-managed-workflow), which reads one angle, `theta`:\n"
msgstr "Contoh pada halaman ini menggunakan aliran kerja daripada [Jalankan aliran kerja terurus](/guides/run-managed-workflow), yang membaca satu sudut, `theta`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Start the jobs {#start-the-jobs}"
msgstr "Mulakan job {#start-the-jobs}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Get the workflow by its title, and call `run()` one time for each input. Save the job IDs to a file:\n"
"**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"
msgstr ""
"Dapatkan aliran kerja melalui tajuknya, dan panggil `run()` sekali bagi setiap input. Simpan ID job ke dalam fail:\n"
"**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Check every input first.** If the workflow has an [argument schema](/guides/managed-workflow-inputs-and-outputs#best-practice-validate-arguments-with-a-schema), call `validate_arguments()` on each input before the loop.\n"
msgstr "**Semak setiap input terlebih dahulu.** Jika aliran kerja mempunyai [skema argumen](/guides/managed-workflow-inputs-and-outputs#best-practice-validate-arguments-with-a-schema), panggil `validate_arguments()` pada setiap input sebelum gelung.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Save the job IDs to a file.** You can then collect the results from a new session.\n"
msgstr "**Simpan ID job ke dalam fail.** Anda kemudian boleh mengumpul hasil daripada sesi baharu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Give each run's files a unique name.** All runs share the workflow's file storage. See [Best practice: give each run's files a unique name](/guides/manage-files-across-managed-workflows#best-practice-give-each-runs-files-a-unique-name).\n"
msgstr "**Beri nama unik kepada fail setiap larian.** Semua larian berkongsi storan fail aliran kerja. Lihat [Amalan terbaik: beri nama unik kepada fail setiap larian](/guides/manage-files-across-managed-workflows#best-practice-give-each-runs-files-a-unique-name).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Stay under the [active job limit](#active-job-limit).** A managed workflow does not queue jobs over the limit, so when you reach it, start more jobs only after earlier jobs end.\n"
msgstr "**Kekal di bawah [had job aktif](#active-job-limit).** Aliran kerja terurus tidak menyusun job yang melebihi had dalam baris gilir, jadi apabila anda mencapainya, mulakan lebih banyak job hanya selepas job terdahulu tamat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Collect the results {#collect-the-results}"
msgstr "Kumpulkan hasil {#collect-the-results}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Get each job by its ID, and catch failed jobs so that one failure does not stop the loop:\n"
"**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"
msgstr ""
"Dapatkan setiap job melalui ID-nya, dan tangkap job yang gagal supaya satu kegagalan tidak menghentikan gelung:\n"
"**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To rerun the inputs that failed, call `run()` again with the same arguments.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menjalankan semula input yang gagal, panggil `run()` sekali lagi dengan argumen yang sama.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Active job limit {#active-job-limit}"
msgstr "Had job aktif {#active-job-limit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can have up to 50 jobs that are queued, initializing, running, or canceling at the same time. This limit counts all of your jobs, including jobs of other workflows. If you exceed this limit, `run()` raises a `QiskitServerlessException` and does not create or queue the job:\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh mempunyai sehingga 50 job yang berada dalam baris gilir, memulakan, berjalan atau membatalkan pada masa yang sama. Had ini mengira semua job anda, termasuk job aliran kerja lain. Jika anda melebihi had ini, `run()` menimbulkan `QiskitServerlessException` dan tidak mencipta atau menyusun job dalam baris gilir:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- [Manage files across runs](/guides/manage-files-across-managed-workflows) to share input files between runs and give each run's files a unique name.\n"
"- [Choose a compute profile](/guides/managed-workflow-compute-profiles) to run each job of the sweep on a size that matches its input.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"
"- [Urus fail merentasi larian](/guides/manage-files-across-managed-workflows) untuk berkongsi fail input antara larian dan memberi nama unik kepada fail setiap larian.\n"
"- [Pilih profil pengiraan](/guides/managed-workflow-compute-profiles) untuk menjalankan setiap job sapuan pada saiz yang sepadan dengan inputnya.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
